{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382420/extras/MCBanner.png?t=1740920223\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A wandering soul finds themselves lost in a pastel-colored world of unimaginable terror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide them through mind-boggling events which blur the line between dreams and reality, and navigate logic-defying encounters with familiar faces who claim to be the wanderer's past selves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>All hope seems lost until a supposed goddess - claiming to be the key to our hero's escape - offers her help in exchange for becoming her vessel...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382420/extras/SteamBanner4.png?t=1740920223\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Explore unique worlds filled with threats, puzzles and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Help, save and clash with past versions of yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Unravel the mystery behind two gods and a half at war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Answer the question... <i>can you really trust your self</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382420/extras/SteamBanner3.png?t=1740920223\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>PSYCHExFUSE</strong></i> will be a 3-part saga, with <i><strong>Part 1: L.C.D</strong></i> launching as an Early Access Title in Q2 2025. The remaining parts will be released as free updates as they are completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dream Surfer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publ